one\\\\\\\" data-target=\\\\\\\"p2002012-contract-ticket-0000000000001\\\\\\\">收票记录</a></li></ul></div><div class=\\\\\\\"op-content\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"op-actbar\\\\\\\"><span class=\\\\\\\"op-actbtn\\\\\\\" data-op=\\\\\\\"startone\\\\\\\" data-process=\\\\\\\"p2002001-contract-approve-000000000001\\\\\\\">发起合同审批流程</span><span class=\\\\\\\"op-actbtn plain\\\\\\\" data-op=\\\\\\\"startone\\\\\\\" data-process=\\\\\\\"p2002002-contract-supplement-0000000001\\\\\\\">合同补录</span><span class=\\\\\\\"op-actbtn plain\\\\\\\" data-op=\\\\\\\"startone\\\\\\\" data-process=\\\\\\\"p2002003-contract-change-00000000001\\\\\\\">信息变更</span></div><div class=\\\\\\\"op-view-wrap\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"op-view-cap\\\\\\\">合同台账（实时数据）</div><div class=\\\\\\\"op-tbl-wrap\\\\\\\" data-embed-table=\\\\\\\"t2002001-contract-main-table-0000000001|[{&quot;k&quot;: &quot;contract_no&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;合同编号&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;contract_name&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;合同名称&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;contract_type&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;类型&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;project_no&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;项目编号&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;sign_unit&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;签约单位&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;contract_amount&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;合同金额&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;money&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;receive_total&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;已收金额&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;money&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;perform_rate&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;履约率&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;num&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;contract_status&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;状态&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}]\\\\\\\" data-page-size=\\\\\\\"50\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"height:430px\\\\\\\"></div></div><div class=\\\\\\\"op-view-wrap\\\\\\\"><div class=\\\\\\\"op-view-cap\\\\\\\">合同收款记录</div><div class=\\\\\\\"op-tbl-wrap\\\\\\\" data-embed-table=\\\\\\\"t2002003-contract-receive-table-000000001|[{&quot;k&quot;: &quot;receive_no&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;收款单号&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;contract_no&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;合同编号&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;receive_type&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;收款类型&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;receive_amount&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;收款金额&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;money&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;receive_date&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;到账日期&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;date&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;payer_name&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;付款方&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}, {&quot;k&quot;: &quot;receive_status&quot;, &quot;t&quot;: &quot;状态&quot;, &quot;f&quot;: &quot;&quot;}]\\\\\\\" data-page-size=\\\\\\\"50\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"height:280px\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\\n</div></div></div>\\\", \\\"container\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"properties\\\": {}, \\\"class\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"styles\\\": {}, \\\"recoveryStyles\\\": null, \\\"isSaved\\\": true, \\\"pid\\\": \\\"PCo2002003-contract-portal-list-page-000001html\\\", \\\"moduleName\\\": \\\"html\\\"}}, \\\"fieldList\\\": {}, \\\"css\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"\\\"}, \\\"pageStyleType\\\": \\\"blue-simple\\\", \\\"pid\\\": \\\"PCo2002003-contract-portal-list-page-000001o2002003-contract-portal-list-page-000001\\\", \\\"formStyleType\\\": \\\"default\\\", \\\"widgetList\\\": [], \\\"languageType\\\": \\\"none\\\", \\\"languageScript\\\": {\\\"code\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"html\\\": \\\"\\\"}}, \\\"html\\\": \\\"<div mwftype=\\\\\\\"form\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"o2002003-contract-portal-list-page-000001\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"css csso2002003contractportallistpage000001\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"><div mwftype=\\\\\\\"html\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"html\\\\\\\" style=\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"></div></div>\\\", \\\"id\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"isNewPage\\\": false}",
